lists BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrigger BalgasDais/Burning_Circle/onTrigger BalgasDais/onEventUpdate/32000 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32000 BalgasDais/onEventUpdate/32003 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32003
